        "original_id": "d776c63e-0e30-5e0c-bbd2-74c7702c5efc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mychal Thompson\n- Organizations: San Antonio Spurs, Golden State Warriors, University of Minnesota, Portland Trail Blazers, Los Angeles Lakers, Boston Celtics, Chicago Bulls\n- Places: San Antonio, AT&T Center\n- Roles: Power forward, Center\n- Topics: NBA championships\n\nFacts:\n- Mychal Thompson played the power forward and center positions for the University of Minnesota before playing in the NBA.\n- Mychal Thompson played in the NBA for the Portland Trail Blazers, San Antonio Spurs, and Los Angeles Lakers.\n- The San Antonio Spurs play their home games at the AT&T Center in San Antonio.\n- The Golden State Warriors have won five NBA championships.\n- The Golden State Warriors and the San Antonio Spurs are tied for the fourth-most NBA championships in league history.\n- The Boston Celtics have 17 NBA championships, the Los Angeles Lakers have 16, and the Chicago Bulls have 6.",
